#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Generate or check the pinned upstream OpenSSL 3 crypto oracle fixture.

Reads only pinned git objects from the upstream checkout. Complete definitions
are extracted at their checked boundaries into a temporary declaration shim;
the pinned AES-SIV source and header are compiled whole. No upstream working
files are consulted. The fixture includes compiler and provider provenance, so
regeneration on a different toolchain may legitimately differ and needs review.

Exit 0: success; 1: invalid extraction/content or fixture mismatch;
2: usage, I/O, git, compiler or harness failure. --generated-form runs the
separate randomized SEC1 point-form check and never writes the fixture;
--verify-signature checks external SHA-256/DER signatures with the upstream
verifier without modifying the fixture.
"""
